        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vincent Walker, David Usher, Brian Robertson\n- Bands: Suburban Legends, Moist, Bomb Squad\n- Roles: lead singer, multi-instrumentalist, trombone player, author, keynote speaker, activist\n- Places: Orange County\n\nFacts:\n- David Usher was born on April 24, 1966.\n- David Usher is an English-born Canadian musician, best-selling author, keynote speaker, and activist.\n- David Usher is known as the lead singer of the alternative rock band Moist.\n- Brian Robertson was born on October 19, 1979.\n- Brian Robertson is the trombone player for the Orange County-based third-wave ska band Suburban Legends.\n- Brian Robertson, along with Vincent Walker, is one of two members who have played with Suburban Legends since its origin as Bomb Squad.\n- Vincent Francis Walker was born on March 2, 1980.\n- Vincent Francis Walker is better known as Vince Walker.\n- Vince Walker is an American multi-instrumentalist.\n- Vince Walker is best known as the lead singer of the third-wave ska band Suburban Legends.",
